OL,3,GNEWSABurnham joined by former PMs at
OL,4,AWiddecombe service
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has been joined by former
OL,7,Fprime ministers at a memorial service
OL,8,Ffor the late politician Ann Widdecombe.
OL,10,FThe Service of Remembrance at
OL,11,FWestminster Cathedral is taking place
OL,12,Fthis afternoon, with eulogies to be
OL,13,Fdelivered and a choir set to sing.
OL,15,FAbout 600 guests are due to attend,
OL,16,Fwith David Cameron, Liz Truss, Boris
OL,17,FJohnson and Rishi Sunak among them.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
